chụp chính diện, ảnh đo kích thước (Dimension View), ảnh mở cánh tủ (Interior View) và ảnh phối cảnh phòng (Room Setting).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Thông số Kỹ thuật, Kích thước &amp; Giá quy đổi</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Kích thước lắp đặt (Rộng × Sâu × Cao):</strong> 78 cm × 34 cm × 88 cm (30.7\" × 13.4\" × 34.6\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Trọng lượng tịnh:</strong> 29.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Cấu hình lưu trữ:</strong> 2 Cánh cửa | 4 Ngăn kệ | 1 Ngăn kéo (12 đôi giày + 1 ngăn kéo phụ kiện)</li>\n  <li><strong>Tùy chọn Màu sắc / Hoàn thiện:</strong> Nâu Milky Wenge, Xám đá Slate</li>\n  <li><strong>Giá niêm yết &amp; Khuyến mãi (VND):</strong> <del>3,300,000 ₫</del> → <strong>2,400,000 ₫</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Giá quy đổi Quốc tế (USD):</strong> <del>$132.00</del> → <strong>$96.00</strong> (Giá gốc DeSpace: ₹7,999 / ₹10,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Không gian phù hợp:</strong> Living Room (Tông ánh sáng: Natural)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Hướng dẫn Bảo quản &amp; Lắp đặt</h4>\n<p>Lau bề mặt định kỳ bằng khăn mềm khô hoặc hơi ẩm; không dùng hóa chất tẩy rửa mạnh có chứa dung môi. Đặt các vật nặng ở tầng kệ dưới cùng để giữ trọng tâm vững chắc và sử dụng bộ ngàm chống lật gắn tường đi kèm đối với các mẫu tủ cao.</p>\n<p><em>Sản phẩm chính hãng nhập khẩu theo tiêu chuẩn DeSpace Storage Collection — Giao hàng đóng kiện phẳng (Flat-pack) bảo vệ góc cạnh kèm sách hướng dẫn lắp đặt chi tiết.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"132.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"19\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"29.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"78\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"34\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:2:\"88\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:23:\"Tủ giày & Lưu trữ\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:63:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279618/pexels-photo-279618.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:10:\"Màu sắc\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:33:\"Nâu Milky Wenge, Xám đá Slate\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:13:\"Chất liệu\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:73:\"Gỗ công nghiệp phủ Laminate 2 tông màu, Ray trượt bi 3 tầng\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:114:\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/master/2.0/SheenChair/glTF-Binary/SheenChair.glb\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:7:\"Natural\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:168:\"Hoàn thiện bề mặt Laminate Nâu Milky Wenge, Xám đá Slate chống ẩm, kết cấu 2 cánh cửa, 4 tầng kệ (12 đôi giày + 1 ngăn kéo phụ kiện).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#3A2E2B, #F4F1EA\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:4:\"Sale\";}s:6:\"en_usd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:1:\"4\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-004\";s:4:\"Name\";s:49:\"DeSpace Slate Two Door Shoe Cabinet - Milky Wenge\";s:9:\"Published\";s:1:\"1\";s:12:\"Is featured?\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"Visibility in catalog\";s:7:\"visible\";s:17:\"Short description\";s:268:\"Space-saving DeSpace Slate Two Door Shoe Cabinet - Milky Wenge (78W × 34D × 88H cm) offering 12 Pairs + Top Utility Drawer, crafted from engineered wood, two-tone matte laminate, telescopic drawer channels with multi-angle hover dimension and interior gallery views.\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2699:\"<h3>Smart Architectural Storage with Multi-Angle Hover Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-slate-two-door-shoe-cabinet-milky-wenge</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Slate Two Door Shoe Cabinet - Milky Wenge</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>78 cm (Width) × 34 cm (Depth) × 88 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Two-Tone Matte Laminate, Telescopic Drawer Channels — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Milky Wenge, Slate Gray laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 2 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s), and 1 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>12 Pairs + Top Utility Drawer</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 78 cm × 34 cm × 88 cm (30.7\" × 13.4\" × 34.6\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 29.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 2 Doors | 4 Shelves | 1 Drawers (12 Pairs + Top Utility Drawer)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Milky Wenge, Slate Gray</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$132.00</del> → <strong>$96.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,300,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,400,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹7,999 / ₹10,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"132.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"19\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"29.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"78\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"34\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:2:\"88\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:20:\"Shoe Racks & Storage\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:63:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279618/pexels-photo-279618.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:23:\"Milky Wenge, Slate Gray\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:68:\"Engineered Wood, Two-Tone Matte Laminate, Telescopic Drawer Channels\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:114:\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/master/2.0/SheenChair/glTF-Binary/SheenChair.glb\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:7:\"Natural\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:120:\"Finished in Milky Wenge, Slate Gray matte laminate featuring 2 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s) (12 Pairs + Top Util