enge</li>\n  <li><strong>Giá niêm yết &amp; Khuyến mãi (VND):</strong> <del>2,700,000 ₫</del> → <strong>1,950,000 ₫</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Giá quy đổi Quốc tế (USD):</strong> <del>$108.00</del> → <strong>$78.00</strong> (Giá gốc DeSpace: ₹6,499 / ₹8,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Không gian phù hợp:</strong> Living Room (Tông ánh sáng: Natural)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Hướng dẫn Bảo quản &amp; Lắp đặt</h4>\n<p>Lau bề mặt định kỳ bằng khăn mềm khô hoặc hơi ẩm; không dùng hóa chất tẩy rửa mạnh có chứa dung môi. Đặt các vật nặng ở tầng kệ dưới cùng để giữ trọng tâm vững chắc và sử dụng bộ ngàm chống lật gắn tường đi kèm đối với các mẫu tủ cao.</p>\n<p><em>Sản phẩm chính hãng nhập khẩu theo tiêu chuẩn DeSpace Storage Collection — Giao hàng đóng kiện phẳng (Flat-pack) bảo vệ góc cạnh kèm sách hướng dẫn lắp đặt chi tiết.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"108.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"78.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"20\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"35.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"62\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"33\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"119\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:23:\"Tủ giày & Lưu trữ\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:63:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:338:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6186523/pexels-photo-6186523.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:10:\"Màu sắc\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:44:\"Gỗ sồi Sonoma phối Trắng, Nâu Wenge\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:13:\"Chất liệu\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:98:\"Gỗ công nghiệp chống ẩm, Cánh tủ xẻ rãnh thoáng khí, Ngàm chống lật an toàn\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:122:\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/master/2.0/GlamVelvetSofa/glTF-Binary/GlamVelvetSofa.glb\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:7:\"Natural\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:167:\"Hoàn thiện bề mặt Laminate Gỗ sồi Sonoma phối Trắng, Nâu Wenge chống ẩm, kết cấu 2 cánh cửa, 6 tầng kệ (18 đôi giày (6 tầng kệ)).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#D2B48C, #FFFFFF\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:4:\"Sale\";}s:6:\"en_usd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:1:\"7\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-007\";s:4:\"Name\";s:55:\"DeSpace Fusion Tall Shoe Cabinet - Sonoma Oak and White\";s:9:\"Published\";s:1:\"1\";s:12:\"Is featured?\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"Visibility in catalog\";s:7:\"visible\";s:17:\"Short description\";s:268:\"Space-saving DeSpace Fusion Tall Shoe Cabinet - Sonoma Oak and White (62W × 33D × 119H cm) offering 18 Pairs of Shoes (6 Tiers), crafted from engineered wood, ventilated door slots, anti-tip wall restraint with multi-angle hover dimension and interior gallery views.\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2707:\"<h3>Smart Architectural Storage with Multi-Angle Hover Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-fusion-tall-shoe-cabinet-sonoma-oak-and-white</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Fusion Tall Shoe Cabinet - Sonoma Oak and White</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>62 cm (Width) × 33 cm (Depth) × 119 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Ventilated Door Slots, Anti-Tip Wall Restraint — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Sonoma Oak & White, Wenge laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 2 door(s), 6 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>18 Pairs of Shoes (6 Tiers)</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 62 cm × 33 cm × 119 cm (24.4\" × 13.0\" × 46.9\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 35.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 2 Doors | 6 Shelves | 0 Drawers (18 Pairs of Shoes (6 Tiers))</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Sonoma Oak & White, Wenge</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$108.00</del> → <strong>$78.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>2,700,000 VND</del> → <strong>1,950,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹6,499 / ₹8,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"108.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"78.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"