lors:</strong> Columbia Walnut, Wenge</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$156.00</del> → <strong>$120.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,900,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,000,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹9,999 / ₹12,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"120.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"16\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"50.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"75\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"32\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"183\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:20:\"Shoe Racks & Storage\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:66:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Popular\";s:6:\"Images\";s:338:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6186523/pexels-photo-6186523.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:22:\"Columbia Walnut, Wenge\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:67:\"Heavy-Duty Engineered Wood, Ventilated Shutters, 9 Internal Shelves\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:114:\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/mas