>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 3 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>15 Pairs of Shoes</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 110 cm × 33 cm × 71 cm (43.3\" × 13.0\" × 28.0\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 28.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 3 Doors | 4 Shelves | 0 Drawers (15 Pairs of Shoes)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Yellow & Brown Two-Tone</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$96.00</del> → <strong>$72.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>2,400,000 VND</del> → <strong>1,800,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹5,999 / ₹7,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"72.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"12\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"28.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:3:\"110\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"33\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:2:\"71\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:20:\"Shoe Racks & Storage\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:63:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:338:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https: