or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> 15mm Body & 25mm Thick Shelves Engineered Wood, Textured Wenge Laminate — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Wenge, Sonoma Oak & White laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 3 door(s), 5 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>15–18 Pairs of Shoes</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 84 cm × 32 cm × 114 cm (33.1\" × 12.6\" × 44.9\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 35.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 3 Doors | 5 Shelves | 0 Drawers (15–18 Pairs of Shoes)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Wenge, Sonoma Oak & White</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$96.00</del> → <strong>$76.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>2,400,000 VND</del> → <strong>1,890,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹6,299 / ₹7,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"76.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"15\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"35.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"84\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"32\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"114\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:20:\"Shoe Racks & Storage\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:63:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Shoe Racks & Storage, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279618/pexels-photo-279618.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:25:\"Wenge, Sonoma Oak & White\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:71:\"15mm Body & 25mm Thick Shelves Engineered Wood, Textured Wenge Laminate\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:114:\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Models/master/2.0/SheenChair/glTF-Binary/SheenChair.glb\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:4:\"Warm\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:115:\"Finished in Wenge, Sonoma Oak & White matte laminate featuring 3 door(s), 5 shelf tier(s) (15–18 Pairs of Shoes).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#362823, #D2B48C\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:4:\"Sale\";}s:6:\"vi_vnd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:2:\"14\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-014\";s:4:\"Name\";s:60:\"Tủ giày 3 cán