d room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Steel Hanging Rod, Ventilated Lower Shoe Section — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Wenge, Columbia Walnut laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 3 door(s), 9 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>15 Pairs + Hanging Rod & Linen Shelves</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 112 cm × 40 cm × 183 cm (44.1\" × 15.7\" × 72.0\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 54.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 3 Doors | 9 Shelves | 0 Drawers (15 Pairs + Hanging Rod & Linen Shelves)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Wenge, Columbia Walnut</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$180.00</del> → <strong>$139.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>4,500,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,480,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹11,599 / ₹14,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"180.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"1