e\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-021\";s:4:\"Name\";s:49:\"DeSpace Wardura Three Door Wardrobe - Lome Cherry\";s:9:\"Published\";s:1:\"1\";s:12:\"Is featured?\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"Visibility in catalog\";s:7:\"visible\";s:17:\"Short description\";s:286:\"Space-saving DeSpace Wardura Three Door Wardrobe - Lome Cherry (115W × 45D × 182H cm) offering Couple Wardrobe Layout (Rod + 5 Shelves), crafted from engineered wood, warm reddish-brown cherry laminate, lockable compartment with multi-angle hover dimension and interior gallery views.\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2735:\"<h3>Smart Architectural Storage with Multi-Angle Hover Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-wardura-three-door-wardrobe-lome-cherry</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Wardura Three Door Wardrobe - Lome Cherry</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>115 cm (Width) × 45 cm (Depth) × 182 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Warm Reddish-Brown Cherry Laminate, Lockable Compartment — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Lome Cherry, Columbia Walnut laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 3 door(s), 5 shelf tier(s), and 1 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>Couple Wardrobe Layout (Rod + 5 Shelves)</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 115 cm × 45 cm × 182 cm (45.3\" × 17.7\" × 71.7\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 62.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 3 Doors | 5 Shelves | 1 Drawers (Couple Wardrobe Layout (Rod + 5 Shelves))</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Lome Cherry, Columbia Walnut</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$204.00</del> → <strong>$156.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>5,100,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,900,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹12,999 / ₹16,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"204.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:1:\"8\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"62.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:3:\"115\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"45\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"182\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:9:\"Wardrobes\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:48:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Wardrobes, Bedroom, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:334:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6186523/pexels-photo-6186523.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279746/pexels-photo-279746.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1454806/pexels-photo-1454806.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1645