urniva-nexa-two-door-wardrobe-with-hanging-rod-lyon-walnut</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Nexa Two Door Wardrobe with Hanging Rod - Lyon Walnut</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>82 cm (Width) × 57 cm (Depth) × 153 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Deep 57cm Hanger Clearance, Matte Laminate — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Lyon Walnut, Giant Wood laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 2 door(s), 3 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>Compact Bedroom Hanging Rod + 3 Shelves</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 82 cm × 57 cm × 153 cm (32.3\" × 22.4\" × 60.2\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 32.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 2 Doors | 3 Shelves | 0 Drawers (Compact Bedroom Hanging Rod + 3 Shelves)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Lyon Walnut, Giant Wood</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$144.00</del> → <strong>$108.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,600,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,700,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹8,999 / ₹11,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"144.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"108.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"15\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"32.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"82\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"57\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"153\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:9:\"Wardrobes\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:48:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Wardrobes, Bedroom, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:334:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6186523/pexels-photo-6186523.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279746/pexels-photo-279746.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1454806/pexels-photo-1454806.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/164595/pexels-photo-164595.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:23:\"Lyon Walnut, Giant Wood\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:59:\"Engineered Wood, Deep 57cm Hanger Clearance, Matte Laminate\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:7:\"Bedroom\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:4:\"Warm\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:130:\"Finished in Lyon Walnut, Giant Wood matte laminate featuring 2 door(s), 3 shelf tier(s) (Compact Bedroom Hanging Rod + 3 Shelves).\";s: