tribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"120.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"12\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"44.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"80\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"48\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"180\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:9:\"Wardrobes\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:52:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Wardrobes, Bedroom, Featured\";s:6:\"Images\";s:334:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6186523/pexels-photo-6186523.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279746/pexels-photo-279746.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1454806/pexels-photo-1454806.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/164595/pexels-photo-164595.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:35:\"Giant Wood (Honey Oak), Lyon Walnut\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:81:\"Engineered Wood, Melamine Coated Open-Grain Oak Finish, Concealed Security Drawer\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:7:\"Bedroom\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:7:\"Natural\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:152:\"Finished in Giant Wood (Honey Oak), Lyon Walnut matte laminate featuring 2 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s) (Hanging Rod + 4 Shelves + Secret Valuables Drawer).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#C19A6B, #6B4423\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:8:\"Featured\";}s:6:\"vi_vnd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:2:\"23\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-023\";s:4:\"Name\";s:87:\"Tủ quần áo 2 cánh 