signed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Giant Wood (Natural Brown), Lyon Walnut laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 2 door(s), 3 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>Compact Bedroom Hanging Rod + 3 Shelves</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 82 cm × 57 cm × 153 cm (32.3\" × 22.4\" × 60.2\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 32.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 2 Doors | 3 Shelves | 0 Drawers (Compact Bedroom Hanging Rod + 3 Shelves)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Giant Wood (Natural Brown), Lyon Walnut</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$132.00</del> → <strong>$96.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,300,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,400,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹7,999 / ₹10,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"132.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"18\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"32.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"82\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"57\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"153\";s:10:\"Categ