s product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Anti-Wobble Shelf Locking System, Wall-Mount Kit Included — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 0 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>4 Locked Shelves (~120 Paperbacks)</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 75 cm × 30 cm × 145 cm (29.5\" × 11.8\" × 57.1\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 29.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 0 Doors | 4 Shelves | 0 Drawers (4 Locked Shelves (~120 Paperbacks))</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$108.00</del> → <strong>$84.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>2,700,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,100,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹6,999 / ₹8,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Study Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"108.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"84.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"18\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"29.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"75\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"30\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"145\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:11:\"Bookshelves\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:53:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Bookshelves, Study Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/1090638/pexels-photo-1090638.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2251247/pexels-photo-2251247.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/667838/pexels-photo-667838.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1957478/pexels-photo-1957478.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571460/pexels-photo-1571460.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:22:\"Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:74:\"Engineered Wood, Anti-Wobble Shelf Locking System, Wall-Mount Kit Included\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:10:\"Study Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:7:\"Natural\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:124:\"Finished in Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak matte laminate featuring 0 door(s), 4 shelf tier(s) (4 Locked Shelves (~120 Paperbacks)).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#D2B48C, #B89772\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:4:\"Sale\";}s:6:\"vi_vnd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:2:\"27\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-027\";s:4:\"Name\";s:74:\"Kệ sách 4 tầng khóa chốt an toàn DeSpace Nova - Gỗ sồi Sonoma\";s:9:\"Published\";s:1:\"1\";s:12:\"Is featured?\";s:1:\"0\";s:21:\"Visibility in catalog\";s:7:\"visible\";s:17:\"