everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 0 door(s), 3 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>3 Locked Shelves (~90 Paperbacks)</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 75 cm × 30 cm × 110 cm (29.5\" × 11.8\" × 43.3\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 22.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 0 Doors | 3 Shelves | 0 Drawers (3 Locked Shelves (~90 Paperbacks))</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$84.00</del> → <strong>$60.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>2,100,000 VND</del> → <strong>1,500,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹4,999 / ₹6,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Study Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:4:\"84.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"60.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"26\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"22.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"75\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"30\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"110\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:11:\"Bookshelves\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:53:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Bo