ngineered wood, 5 full-width shelves with locking hardware with multi-angle hover dimension and interior gallery views.\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2755:\"<h3>Smart Architectural Storage with Multi-Angle Hover Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-nova-5-shelf-bookcase-with-shelf-locking-system-sonoma-oak</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Nova 5 Shelf Bookcase with Shelf Locking System - Sonoma Oak</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>75 cm (Width) × 30 cm (Depth) × 180 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Heavy-Duty Engineered Wood, 5 Full-Width Shelves with Locking Hardware — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 0 door(s), 5 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>5 Locked Shelves (~150 Books & Files)</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 75 cm × 30 cm × 180 cm (29.5\" × 11.8\" × 70.9\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 38.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 0 Doors | 5 Shelves | 0 Drawers (5 Locked Shelves (~150 Books & Files))</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$156.00</del> → <strong>$118.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,900,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,940,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹9,798 / ₹12,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Study Room (Natural lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"118.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"12\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"38.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"75\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"30\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"180\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:11:\"Bookshelves\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:53:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Bookshelves, Study Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/1090638/pexels-photo-1090638.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2251247/pexels-photo-2251247.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/667838/pexels-photo-667838.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1957478/pexels-photo-1957478.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571460/pexels-photo-1571460.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:22:\"Sonoma Oak, Modern Oak\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:70:\"Heavy-Duty Engineered Wood, 5 Full-Width Shelves with Locking Hardware\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visi