>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Columbia Walnut, Wenge laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 4 door(s), 6 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>6 Pantry Shelves for Crockery, Appliances & Groceries</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 120 cm × 38 cm × 125 cm (47.2\" × 15.0\" × 49.2\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 52.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 4 Doors | 6 Shelves | 0 Drawers (6 Pantry Shelves for Crockery, Appliances & Groceries)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Columbia Walnut, Wenge</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$204.00</del> → <strong>$156.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>5,100,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,900,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹12,999 / ₹16,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"204.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"14\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"52.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:3:\"120\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"38\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"125\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:16:\"Kitchen Cabinets\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:66:\"DeSpace, 