essly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Stain-Resistant Laminate, Slim Utility Profile — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Wenge, Sonoma Oak laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 2 door(s), 6 shelf tier(s), and 0 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>6 Internal Shelves on Compact 61cm Footprint</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 61 cm × 33 cm × 120 cm (24.0\" × 13.0\" × 47.2\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 34.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 2 Doors | 6 Shelves | 0 Drawers (6 Internal Shelves on Compact 61cm Footprint)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Wenge, Sonoma Oak</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$132.00</del> → <strong>$102.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,300,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,550,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹8,499 / ₹10,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"132.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"102.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"18\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"34.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"61\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"33\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"120\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:16:\"Kitchen Cabinets\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:62:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Kitchen Cabinets, Living Room, Popular\";s:6:\"Images\";s:338:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1080696/pexels-photo-1080696.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1395967/pexels-photo-1395967.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:17:\"Wenge, Sonoma Oak\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:63:\"Engineered Wood, Stain-Resistant Laminate, Slim Utility Profile\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:4:\"Warm\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:129:\"Finished in Wenge, Sonoma Oak matte laminate featuring 2 door(s), 6 shelf tier(s) (6 Internal Shelves on Compact 61cm Footprint).\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_color_hex\";s:16:\"#322620, #D2B48C\";s:19:\"Meta: _axgnud_badge\";s:7:\"Popular\";}s:6:\"vi_vnd\";a:34:{s:2:\"ID\";s:2:\"33\";s:4:\"Type\";s:6:\"simple\";s:3:\"SKU\";s:11:\"AXG-STR-033\";s:4:\"Name\";s:58:\"Tủ bếp 2 cánh 6 ngăn kệ DeSpace Spice - Nâu Wenge\";s:9:\