el>$132.00</del> → <strong>$96.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>3,300,000 VND</del> → <strong>2,400,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹7,999 / ₹10,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"132.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:4:\"96.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"15\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"36.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"65\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"35\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"135\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:16:\"Kitchen Cabinets\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:59:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Kitchen Cabinets, Living Room, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:338:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1080696/pexels-photo-1080696.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1395967/pexels-photo-1395967.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585598/pexels-photo-6585598.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:27:\"Columbia Walnut, Sonoma Oak\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:67:\"Engineered Wood, Wipe-Clean Laminate Surface, Reinforced Base Panel\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud_lighting_tone\";s:4:\"Warm\";s:25:\"Meta: _axgnud_finish_desc\";s:138:\"Finished in 