 Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-avenbury-4-drawer-barn-door-sideboard-rustic-oak</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Avenbury 4 Drawer Barn Door Sideboard - Rustic Oak</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>102 cm (Width) × 40 cm (Depth) × 85 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Farmhouse Cross-Brace Barn Door, Black Iron Hardware — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Rustic Oak, Mocha Walnut laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 1 door(s), 6 shelf tier(s), and 4 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>4 Smooth Drawers + Barn Door Shelving Bay</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 102 cm × 40 cm × 85 cm (40.2\" × 15.7\" × 33.5\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 46.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 1 Doors | 6 Shelves | 4 Drawers (4 Smooth Drawers + Barn Door Shelving Bay)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Rustic Oak, Mocha Walnut</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$192.00</del> → <strong>$144.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>4,800,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,600,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹11,999 / ₹15,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Living Room (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"192.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"144.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"14\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"46.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:3:\"102\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"40\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:2:\"85\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:29:\"Chest of Drawers & Sideboards\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:79:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Chest of Drawers & Sideboards, Living Room, Best Seller\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1454806/pexels-photo-1454806.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279746/pexels-photo-279746.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:24:\"Rustic Oak, Mocha Walnut\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:69:\"Engineered Wood, Farmhouse Cross-Brace Barn Door, Black Iron Hardware\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_glb\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"Meta: _axgnud_room_space\";s:11:\"Living Room\";s:27:\"Meta: _axgnud