Width) × 40 cm (Depth) × 100 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, Telescopic Ball-Bearing Sliders, Anti-Tip Safety Strap — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Mocha Walnut, Ice White laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 0 door(s), 0 shelf tier(s), and 4 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>4 Deep Full-Extension Clothing Drawers</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 80 cm × 40 cm × 100 cm (31.5\" × 15.7\" × 39.4\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 42.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 0 Doors | 0 Shelves | 4 Drawers (4 Deep Full-Extension Clothing Drawers)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Mocha Walnut, Ice White</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$204.00</del> → <strong>$156.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>5,100,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,900,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹12,999 / ₹16,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<