over dimension and interior gallery views.\";s:11:\"Description\";s:2722:\"<h3>Smart Architectural Storage with Multi-Angle Hover Dimension Preview</h3>\n<p>Sourced directly from the DeSpace Storage Units Collection (<code>https://furniva.in/products/furniva-sera-5-drawer-chest-of-drawers-mocha-walnut</code>), the <strong>DeSpace Sera 5 Drawer Chest of Drawers - Mocha Walnut</strong> brings calm, clutter-free organization to modern homes. Measuring <strong>68 cm (Width) × 40 cm (Depth) × 118 cm (Height)</strong>, its tailored footprint fits effortlessly along entryways, hallways, bedrooms, or utility walls.</p>\n<p>Built for interactive e-commerce browsing, this product includes a <strong>Multi-View Hover Image Gallery</strong>: hovering over the product card reveals detailed dimension diagrams (length, depth, height), open-shutter shelf layouts, and room-setting photography.</p>\n<h4>Key Craftsmanship &amp; Design Features</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Premium Materiality:</strong> Engineered Wood, 5 Graduated Drawers, Heavy-Duty Metal Runners — precision-bonded engineered board designed to resist warping and everyday wear.</li>\n  <li><strong>Surface &amp; Finish:</strong> Finished in Mocha Walnut, Sonoma Oak laminate for an even, scratch-resistant, and easy-wipe surface.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interior Storage Architecture:</strong> Configured with 0 door(s), 0 shelf tier(s), and 5 drawer(s) — engineered to hold <strong>5 Vertical Drawers on Compact 68cm Width</strong>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interactive Hover Details:</strong> Includes front elevation, dimension callout sheet, open-door interior view, and lifestyle room placement images.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Dimensions, Technical Specifications &amp; Converted Pricing</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Assembled Dimensions (W × D × H):</strong> 68 cm × 40 cm × 118 cm (26.8\" × 15.7\" × 46.5\")</li>\n  <li><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 45.0 kg</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage Configuration:</strong> 0 Doors | 0 Shelves | 5 Drawers (5 Vertical Drawers on Compact 68cm Width)</li>\n  <li><strong>Available Finishes / Colors:</strong> Mocha Walnut, Sonoma Oak</li>\n  <li><strong>USD Price ($):</strong> <del>$204.00</del> → <strong>$156.00</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>VND Price (₫):</strong> <del>5,100,000 VND</del> → <strong>3,900,000 VND</strong> (Original INR: ₹12,999 / ₹16,999)</li>\n  <li><strong>Recommended Setting:</strong> Bedroom (Warm lighting tone)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Care &amp; Assembly</h4>\n<p>Clean with a dry or slightly damp microfiber cloth — avoid solvent-based cleaners. Distribute weight evenly and place heavier items on lower shelves. Hardware, hex key, and assembly guide are included in flat-pack edge-protected boxes.</p>\n<p><em>Backed by the Official Structural Warranty and 7-Day Free Exchange Policy.</em></p>\";s:13:\"Regular price\";s:5:\"204.0\";s:10:\"Sale price\";s:5:\"156.0\";s:9:\"In stock?\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"Stock\";s:2:\"10\";s:11:\"Weight (kg)\";s:4:\"45.0\";s:11:\"Length (cm)\";s:2:\"68\";s:10:\"Width (cm)\";s:2:\"40\";s:11:\"Height (cm)\";s:3:\"118\";s:10:\"Categories\";s:29:\"Chest of Drawers & Sideboards\";s:4:\"Tags\";s:68:\"DeSpace, Storage Units, Chest of Drawers & Sideboards, Bedroom, Sale\";s:6:\"Images\";s:336:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6489083/pexels-photo-6489083.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/2062431/pexels-photo-2062431.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/6585757/pexels-photo-6585757.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/1454806/pexels-photo-1454806.jpeg, https://images.pexels.com/photos/279746/pexels-photo-279746.jpeg\";s:16:\"Attribute 1 name\";s:6:\"Finish\";s:20:\"Attribute 1 value(s)\";s:24:\"Mocha Walnut, Sonoma Oak\";s:19:\"Attribute 1 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 1 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"Attribute 2 name\";s:8:\"Material\";s:20:\"Attribute 2 value(s)\";s:62:\"Engineered Wood, 5 Graduated Drawers, Heavy-Duty Metal Runners\";s:19:\"Attribute 2 visible\";s:1:\"1\";s:18:\"Attribute 2 global\";s:1:\"1\";s:23:\"Meta: _axgnud_model_gl